            "created_at": "2026-09-25T11:12:45.147Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,</p>\n<p>I’m <strong>Mohamed Hisham</strong>, an <strong>AI &amp; Automation Engineer and n8n specialist</strong>. I’m currently open to freelance, contract, and remote opportunities with companies, agencies, and founders from anywhere.</p>\n<p>I enjoy taking a business process from an initial idea and turning it into a working, documented automation. My experience includes connecting different tools, designing AI-powered workflows, handling edge cases, and building systems with human review and error handling.</p>\n<p>My main skills include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>n8n workflow automation</li>\n<li>AI agents and multi-agent systems</li>\n<li>OpenAI, GPT-4o, OpenRouter and Vapi.ai</li>\n<li>RAG chatbots with Supabase/pgvector</li>\n<li>REST APIs, webhooks and JavaScript</li>\n<li>HubSpot and Salesforce integrations</li>\n<li>PostgreSQL, Python and Docker</li>\n<li>Slack, Telegram, Gmail and WhatsApp automations</li>\n<li>Human-in-the-loop workflows, validation and error handling</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Some projects I’ve built include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>An <strong>autonomous revenue engine</strong> that qualifies leads through AI voice calls, analyzes transcripts, updates HubSpot or Salesforce, and alerts sales teams.</li>\n<li>An <strong>AI customer support workflow</strong> that classifies tickets, responds to routine questions, and escalates urgent cases for human review.</li>\n<li>A <strong>WhatsApp task reminder system</strong> using Google Sheets, Twilio and n8n to group pending tasks by staff member and send consolidated reminders.</li>\n<li>A <strong>RAG chatbot</strong> for car rental support using n8n, Supabase pgvector and OpenRouter.</li>\n<li>A <strong>clinic email triage and booking automation</strong> that classifies enquiries, identifies booking requests, checks Google Calendar availability, offers appointment slots, prevents double booking, sends confirmations, and logs activity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Here is a short Loom walkthrough of my real-estate lead automation project:</p>\n<p><strong>Loom:</strong></p>\n<p><iframe class=\"loom-onebox\" src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/3bf298d110c24af380d732129923b7a7\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" seamless=\"seamless\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-presentation\"></iframe></p>\n<p>You can see more of my work here:</p>\n<p><strong>GitHub portfolio:</strong></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubrepo\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/Mohamed-Hishamx/N8N-Portfolio-Projects\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Mohamed-Hishamx/N8N-Portfolio-Projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n  <img width=\"690\" height=\"344\" src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/d/3/d3c6b845878cce7e02b38f09502ef3c8e427af0f_2_690x344.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"F0EEEC\">\n\n  <h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Mohamed-Hishamx/N8N-Portfolio-Projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - Mohamed-Hishamx/N8N-Portfolio-Projects: This repository showcases production-style data...</a></h3>\n\n    <p><span class=\"github-repo-description\">This repository showcases production-style data automation workflows built with n8n. The projects demonstrate real-world data ingestion, API integration, error handling, deduplication, relational modeling, and analytics-ready outputs using PostgreSQL, SQL, and visualization tools.</span></p>\n</div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohamed-hisham-203176232/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/mohamed-hisham-203176232/</a></p>\n<p>I’m also happy to learn new tools, develop new skills, and work on different project ideas. I enjoy challenging problems and I’m always interested in understanding a new business process and finding a practical way to improve it.</p>\n<p>If you are looking for someone who can design, build, document, and improve AI-powered workflows, feel free to reach out.</p>\n<p>Best regards,<br>\n<strong>Mohamed Hisham</strong><br>\nAI &amp; Automation Engineer | n8n Specialist<br>\n<a href=\"mailto:MohameddHisham@outlook.com\">MohameddHisham@outlook.com</a></p>",
